VK: StageBits::COPY includes VK_PIPELINE_STAGE_2_CLEAR_BIT, so it covers CmdZeroBuffer.

CmdZeroBuffer is CopyBufferRegion from a zero buffer on D3D12 (sync scope COPY) and vkCmdFillBuffer
on Vulkan, which the spec places among the clear commands: VK_PIPELINE_STAGE_2_COPY_BIT "specifies
the execution of all copy commands", VK_PIPELINE_STAGE_2_CLEAR_BIT "the execution of clear commands,
with the exception of vkCmdClearAttachments". Since 1a1b6df split VK_PIPELINE_STAGE_2_TRANSFER_BIT
into COPY_BIT, RESOLVE_BIT and CLEAR_BIT, StageBits::COPY maps to COPY_BIT only, and no NRI stage
covers the fill on both backends: COPY misses it on Vulkan, CLEAR_STORAGE (CLEAR_UNORDERED_ACCESS_VIEW)
misses it on D3D12. NRIDescs.h names no stage for CmdZeroBuffer.

This adds CLEAR_BIT to the COPY mapping and names CmdZeroBuffer in the COPY comment. CLEAR_STORAGE is
unchanged. A COPY barrier now also orders the clear commands CmdClearStorage records (vkCmdClearColorImage,
vkCmdFillBuffer); that is a wider scope, not a different one.
Measured on v190, NVIDIA, Khronos synchronization validation on: copy, barrier {COPY_DESTINATION,
COPY} -> {COPY_DESTINATION, COPY}, CmdZeroBuffer, barrier {COPY_DESTINATION, COPY} -> {COPY_SOURCE,
COPY}, copy reported SYNC-HAZARD-WRITE-AFTER-WRITE at vkCmdFillBuffer ("it must allow these
accesses at VK_PIPELINE_STAGE_2_CLEAR_BIT") and SYNC-HAZARD-READ-AFTER-WRITE at vkCmdCopyBuffer2
("a prior write (VK_ACCESS_2_TRANSFER_WRITE_BIT) at VK_PIPELINE_STAGE_2_CLEAR_BIT"); with the change
it is clean. D3D12 was clean before and after.

diff --git a/Include/NRIDescs.h b/Include/NRIDescs.h
index 68ee4dd..1e6f96f 100644
--- a/Include/NRIDescs.h
+++ b/Include/NRIDescs.h
@@ -470,7 +470,7 @@ NriBits(StageBits, uint32_t,
     MICROMAP                        = NriBit(19),   // Invoked by "Cmd*Micromap*" commands
 
     // Other
-    COPY                            = NriBit(20),   // Invoked by "CmdCopy*", "CmdUpload*" and "CmdReadback*"
+    COPY                            = NriBit(20),   // Invoked by "CmdCopy*", "CmdUpload*", "CmdReadback*" and "CmdZeroBuffer"
     RESOLVE                         = NriBit(21),   // Invoked by "CmdResolveTexture"
     CLEAR_STORAGE                   = NriBit(22),   // Invoked by "CmdClearStorage"
 
diff --git a/Source/VK/ConversionVK.h b/Source/VK/ConversionVK.h
index a443b3a..de3ea69 100644
--- a/Source/VK/ConversionVK.h
+++ b/Source/VK/ConversionVK.h
@@ -424,8 +424,8 @@ constexpr VkPipelineStageFlags2 GetPipelineStageFlags(StageBits stageBits) {
     if (stageBits & StageBits::INDIRECT)
         flags |= VK_PIPELINE_STAGE_2_DRAW_INDIRECT_BIT;
 
-    if (stageBits & StageBits::COPY)
-        flags |= VK_PIPELINE_STAGE_2_COPY_BIT;
+    if (stageBits & StageBits::COPY) // "CmdZeroBuffer" is "vkCmdFillBuffer", a clear command in Vulkan synchronization scopes (a copy on D3D12)
+        flags |= VK_PIPELINE_STAGE_2_COPY_BIT | VK_PIPELINE_STAGE_2_CLEAR_BIT;
 
     if (stageBits & StageBits::RESOLVE)
         flags |= VK_PIPELINE_STAGE_2_RESOLVE_BIT;
